# Pawn is a hard requirement: every score in this addon is Pawn's own number for the scale you
# have active. With this line the game refuses to load Upgrade Scout unless Pawn is installed
# and enabled (the AddOns list then shows "Dependency missing: Pawn"), and Pawn always loads first.
## Dependencies: Pawn

